  <!-- How it works: one document's journey (scroll-pinned) -->
  <section id="cycle" class="zd" aria-label="How it works">
    <svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true"><defs><path id="zd-ring" d="M70 70 m-50 0 a50 50 0 1 1 100 0 a50 50 0 1 1 -100 0"/>
<g id="zd-seal-art"><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="68" fill="#FBF3DF"/><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="64" fill="none" stroke="#1F5A36" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="70" cy="70" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#1F5A36" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<text font-family="DM Mono, monospace" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="3.2" fill="#1F5A36"><textPath href="#zd-ring">ZAYTOUNA · PROCUREMENT · 2026 ·</textPath></text>
<path d="M70 48 C62 56 62 64 70 70 C78 64 78 56 70 48Z" fill="#4E6B2F"/><path d="M70 70 V58" stroke="#FBF3DF" stroke-width="1.2"/>
<text x="70" y="88" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Bricolage Grotesque, sans-serif" font-weight="800" font-size="15" letter-spacing="1" fill="#1F5A36">AWARDED</text></g></defs></svg>
    <div class="zd-sticky">
      <div class="zd-grid">
        <div class="zd-left">
          <span class="zd-eyebrow">How It Works</span>
          <h2 class="zd-h2">One request.<br><em>Six steps to award.</em></h2>
          <ol class="zd-rail"><li data-i="0"><span class="zd-rn">01</span><span class="zd-rl">Request</span></li><li data-i="1"><span class="zd-rn">02</span><span class="zd-rl">Tender</span></li><li data-i="2"><span class="zd-rn">03</span><span class="zd-rl">Bids</span></li><li data-i="3"><span class="zd-rn">04</span><span class="zd-rl">Compliance</span></li><li data-i="4"><span class="zd-rn">05</span><span class="zd-rl">Evaluation</span></li><li data-i="5"><span class="zd-rn">06</span><span class="zd-rl">Award</span></li></ol>
          <div class="zd-copies">
          <article class="zd-copy" data-i="0">
            <div class="zd-kick"><span>Steps 01–03</span><span class="zd-owner"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>Requesting Department</span></div>
            <h3>Purchase request</h3><p>A department raises a need with title, reason, priority, target date, items and specs. It is approved, returned for changes, or rejected.</p><ul><li><span>01</span>Identify need</li><li><span>02</span>Create purchase request</li><li><span>03</span>Request review</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="zd-copy" data-i="1">
            <div class="zd-kick"><span>Step 04</span><span class="zd-owner"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>Sourcing Officer</span></div>
            <h3>Create the tender</h3><p>The approved request becomes a tender with a description, terms and submission dates.</p><ul><li><span>04</span>Create tender</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="zd-copy" data-i="2">
            <div class="zd-kick"><span>Steps 05–06</span><span class="zd-owner"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>Sourcing Officer · Suppliers</span></div>
            <h3>Invite &amp; receive bids</h3><p>Suitable suppliers are invited. They submit prices, technical details and documents before the deadline.</p><ul><li><span>05</span>Select &amp; invite suppliers</li><li><span>06</span>Receive bids / offers</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="zd-copy" data-i="3">
            <div class="zd-kick"><span>Step 07</span><span class="zd-owner"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>Sourcing Officer</span></div>
            <h3>Compliance check</h3><p>Every bid is checked for mandatory documents and marked Compliant, Non-Compliant or Pending Clarification.</p><ul><li><span>07</span>Compliance check</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="zd-copy" data-i="4">
            <div class="zd-kick"><span>Steps 08–10</span><span class="zd-owner"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>Evaluation Committee · Sourcing Manager</span></div>
            <h3>Evaluate &amp; review</h3><p>A four-person committee scores technical and financial offers on pre-set weights and writes one unified report for the Sourcing Manager.</p><ul><li><span>08</span>Technical &amp; financial evaluation</li><li><span>09</span>Unified report</li><li><span>10</span>Sourcing Manager review</li></ul>
          </article>
          <article class="zd-copy" data-i="5">
            <div class="zd-kick"><span>Steps 11–12</span><span class="zd-owner"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21c0-4 4-6 8-6s8 2 8 6"/></svg>Top Committee</span></div>
            <h3>Decision &amp; award</h3><p>High-value tenders go to the Top Committee. The winner is recorded, the tender is closed and everyone is notified.</p><ul><li><span>11</span>Final decision</li><li><span>12</span>Announcement &amp; closure</li></ul>
          </article>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="zd-stage" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="zd-desk"></div>
          <div class="zd-drop"><div class="zd-paper">
            <div class="zd-ph"><span class="zd-doc zd-doc-pr">Purchase Request</span><span class="zd-doc zd-doc-t">Tender</span><span class="zd-ref"><span class="zd-doc-pr">PR-2026-014</span><span class="zd-doc-t">T-2026-031</span></span></div>
            <div class="zd-pt">750 ml glass bottles</div>
            <dl class="zd-rows">
              <div><dt>Department</dt><dd>Production</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Quantity</dt><dd>120,000 units</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Priority</dt><dd><span class="zd-pill">High</span></dd></div>
              <div><dt>Needed by</dt><dd>15 Jan 2027</dd></div>
              <div class="zd-dates"><dt>Bidding</dt><dd>01 Dec → 15 Dec</dd></div>
            </dl>
            <div class="zd-sign"><span class="zd-ok">✓ Approved · Dept. Manager</span></div>
            <div class="zd-stamp-t">Tender<br><small>Published</small></div>
          </div></div>
          <div class="zd-bids"><div class="zd-bid zd-bA" data-k="A"><div class="zd-bid-h"><span class="zd-bid-id">Bid A</span><span class="zd-flag zd-ok">✓ Compliant</span></div><b>Amman Glass Co.</b><span class="zd-price">JOD 0.142 / unit</span>
<div class="zd-score"><div><span>Technical · 70%</span><i style="--w:.9"></i></div><div><span>Financial · 30%</span><i style="--w:.74"></i></div><strong>86<small>/100</small></strong></div>
<div class="zd-seal zd-on-bid"><svg viewBox="0 0 140 140"><use href="#zd-seal-art"/></svg></div></div><div class="zd-bid zd-bB" data-k="B"><div class="zd-bid-h"><span class="zd-bid-id">Bid B</span><span class="zd-flag zd-no">✕ Non-compliant</span></div><b>Levant Pack</b><span class="zd-price">JOD 0.131 / unit</span>
<div class="zd-score"><div><span>Technical · 70%</span><i style="--w:.78"></i></div><div><span>Financial · 30%</span><i style="--w:.8"></i></div><strong>—<small>/100</small></strong></div>
</div><div class="zd-bid zd-bC" data-k="C"><div class="zd-bid-h"><span class="zd-bid-id">Bid C</span><span class="zd-flag zd-ok">✓ Compliant</span></div><b>Nour Bottles</b><span class="zd-price">JOD 0.138 / unit</span>
<div class="zd-score"><div><span>Technical · 70%</span><i style="--w:.78"></i></div><div><span>Financial · 30%</span><i style="--w:.8"></i></div><strong>78<small>/100</small></strong></div>
</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
